<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: 0, background: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: 'Source Han Sans SC, Microsoft YaHei, Arial, sans-serif' }}>
  <Box style={{ width: 1280, height: 68, background: '#1E4FA8', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>通用 AI 正在替学生把作业写完</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#C9DBF5' }}>01 · PROBLEM</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ width: 1280, height: 1, background: '#D6DCE5' }} />
  <Box style={{ width: 1280, height: 581, paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60, paddingTop: 26, paddingBottom: 18, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 18 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 436, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 646, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 646, height: 136, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', paddingLeft: 20, paddingRight: 20, paddingTop: 14, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>学习过程被替代</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>学生拿到的是答案，不是排查思路；下次遇到同类问题仍然不会处理。</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ width: 646, height: 136, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', paddingLeft: 20, paddingRight: 20, paddingTop: 14, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>幻觉无法核对</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>看似合理的函数名、参数与「参考资料」，学生没有能力判别真伪。</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ width: 646, height: 136, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', paddingLeft: 20, paddingRight: 20, paddingTop: 14, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>脱离课程实际</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>解法常超出已讲授范围，与教师指定的教材、实验手册不一致。</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ width: 490, background: '#E8EFF8', paddingLeft: 30, paddingRight: 30, paddingTop: 34, paddingBottom: 30, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 20 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>我们的定位</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 38, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', lineHeight: 1.35 }}>拒绝给答案、<br />只给可溯源提示</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>只依据教师上传的课程资料作答，资料里没有就明确说没有。</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 60, background: '#E8EFF8', borderLeft: '4px solid #1E4FA8', paddingLeft: 22, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>结论：把 AI 用于「促进理解」，而不是「替代完成」。</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 670, left: 60, width: 1160, height: 24, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>知实 AI（EduRAG）· 决赛答辩</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>02 / 13</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
